    "Details": "The B configuration delivers concentrated long-range punch with the formidable Hyper PPC enhanced by TEMPEST plasma augmentation, unleashing devastating kinetic and thermal strikes. A massive Railgun and Heavy Siege Laser provide powerful complementary firepower, capable of shredding armor and fortifications. Two AMS Mk 2 units bolster defense against missile salvos, ensuring survivability in drawn-out engagements. This setup demands careful heat management but excels in breaking enemy lines with overwhelming precision and sheer destructive force.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Energy</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.45</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
